2. "3 se zyada frames add kyu nahi ho rahe the?" (FIXED)

    Wajah: Har web browser ke localStorage ki ek strict 5 MB memory limit hoti hai. Jab phone/PC se bina compression ke badi photo (1.5MB–3MB) upload hoti thi, to 3 photos me hi 5MB memory 100% full ho jaati thi. Chauthe (4th) frame par browser QuotaExceededError throw kar deta tha aur save ruk jaata tha.

    Ab kya kiya:

        storageService.saveProducts aur supabaseService.addProduct ko Quota-Resilient bana diya hai (agar browser cache full bhi ho to app crash nahi hoga aur Supabase Cloud me data seamlessly save hoga).

        Ab aap 10, 50, 100+ frames aasaani se add kar sakte hain bina ruke!

