        imageCompressor.ts me Smart Browser RFP Detection laga diya hai.

        Agar aap Firefox Private Browsing / Parrot OS me hain, to ye canvas ko touch hi nahi karega aur seedhe direct FileReader se bina kisi distortion ya stripes ke original photo load karega.

