The error Encountered two children with the same key, 'all' has been resolved:
Root Cause & Fix

    Cause: The category filter was automatically prepending { id: 'all', label: 'All Collection' } as the top filter button, while { id: 'all' } was also being saved as an entry inside the categories list from the cloud, creating two React children with the identical key "all".

    Fix:

        Updated Catalog.tsx to automatically exclude "all" from custom categories and deduplicate all category IDs before prepending the top "All Collection" button.

        Updated supabaseService.ts to ensure "all" is never persisted as an individual category in Supabase or local storage.

        Filtered out "all" in AdminModal.tsx table and frame category dropdowns.

        Cleaned the cloud record in Supabase so only genuine product categories (men, women, bluecut, sunglasses, etc.) are returned.

